#: ui/dialogs/settings-dialog.slint:1710
msgid "Mark messages as read"
msgstr "İletileri okundu olarak işaretle"

#: ui/dialogs/settings-dialog.slint:1711
msgid ""
"When an unread message you open counts as read. With a delay, messages you "
