#: ui/dialogs/settings-dialog.slint:2617
msgid "Clean up"
msgstr "Temizlik"

#: ui/dialogs/settings-dialog.slint:2634
msgid ""
"Deletes mail for good once it has been in Trash this long. Starred mail "
